        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jagmeet Singh, John Sharples\n- Organizations: New Democratic Party, Ontario New Democratic Party, Ontario New Democratic Youth\n- Events: 2017 New Democratic Party leadership election\n\nFacts:\n- John Sharples was born on 24 January 1847 and died on 30 July 1913.\n- John Sharples was a Canadian business person and politician.\n- Jagmeet Singh Jimmy Dhaliwal was born on January 2, 1979.\n- Jagmeet Singh is a Canadian politician known professionally as Jagmeet Singh.\n- Jagmeet Singh is the leader of the New Democratic Party.\n- The Ontario New Democratic Youth is the youth wing of the Ontario New Democratic Party.\n- The Ontario New Democratic Party is affiliated with the federal New Democratic Party.\n- Jagmeet Singh succeeded the previous leader of the New Democratic Party after winning the party's 2017 leadership election on October 1 with 53.8% of the vote.",
